My next game of thrones video will be about
the Faceless Men. I know a lot of you have

00:11:50.160 --> 00:11:53.110
been asking for it. Be sure to subscribe to
get it. I’ll post it next sunday. I will

00:11:53.110 --> 00:12:00.110
be doing a Q&amp;A video for this, so I’ll post
that next and then another Doctor Who video.

